Dialogue: 0,0:00:00.40,0:00:04.36,Default,,0,0,0,,I always sat in the back seat growing\Nup.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:07.40,0:00:10.59,Default,,0,0,0,,Watching my older siblings take the\Nwheel.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:14.00,0:00:18.12,Default,,0,0,0,,Then came the day I sat in the driver's\Nseat.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:21.00,0:00:23.94,Default,,0,0,0,,My hands gripped the wheel so tight.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:27.60,0:00:30.64,Default,,0,0,0,,Checking the mirror over and over.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:34.20,0:00:37.98,Default,,0,0,0,,Now my phone lights up, day or night.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:41.20,0:00:44.80,Default,,0,0,0,,I drive my sisters home at night.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:47.80,0:00:52.02,Default,,0,0,0,,By day, I take my parents on their\Nerrands.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:54.40,0:00:59.04,Default,,0,0,0,,The little ones sit on my lap and hold\Nthe wheel.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:01.00,0:01:04.71,Default,,0,0,0,,The quiet kid from the back seat...
Dialogue: 0,0:01:07.60,0:01:11.23,Default,,0,0,0,,...is the one who brings everyone home.
